[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3 uid="uid://unitprimitivemeshnormalmap"]

; The one variable: the tangent frame a PlaneMesh and a BoxMesh carry under a normal map. Godot
; writes one constant tangent per face, and a directional, an omni and a spot light each shade the
; bumps through it. The only other normal-mapped PlaneMesh is overexposed, so its bumps barely show,
; and no other scene normal-maps a BoxMesh.

